  "title": "Copper at Record Highs: Structural Demand Meets Constrained Supply",
  "summary": "Copper is reaching record highs as a tightening supply picture collides with a new era of strategic demand. Constrained concentrate markets and slow mine growth are revealing just how little flexibility exists across the global copper supply chain. We examine why these dynamics reinforce our bullish outlook for copper and copper miners.",
